From 9b6b5d83af14c52e1c5fc6fb38718c2364aa77af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:42:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1763/3799] soh: rename D_8016110C -> sCurCutIndex

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: which entry of sDbCameraCuts the debug camera is currently playing back; the playback routine skips unused slots by advancing it and the on-screen list marks it with a caret.
Defined in soh/src/code/db_camera.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/db_camera.c | 53 ++++++++++++++++++++--------------------
 1 file changed, 27 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)

